    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the pages of a mysterious book called <strong>Paplion</strong>, strange monsters can be found. Those are called <strong>Papling</strong>, monsters born from paper. After being absorbed by the book, you will meet your partner <strong>Papling</strong> and together you will go in an adventure through the chapters of <strong>Paplion</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/04f83e1274e713e896281d975e08704c.poster.avif?t=1754100960\" width=64 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/04f83e1274e713e896281d975e08704c.webm?t=1754100960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Papling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find more than 100 different <strong>Papling</strong> to <strong>befriend</strong> and add them to your <strong>deck</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/2948702acb7787066c92ab8acbd95098.poster.avif?t=1754100960\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/2948702acb7787066c92ab8acbd95098.apng?t=1754100960\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose their evolution line</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Papling</strong> have <strong>3 evolutive stages</strong>. Those that aren't in the last stage can choose between 3 different evolutions to evolve, becoming stronger and gaining <strong>new abilities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/dfe8191390533eae6e688ec0d4e059e2.avif?t=1754100960\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple paths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paplion</strong> has <strong>6 chapters,</strong> each of them with its own world to explore and you can choose in which order you will play them. Also, each of them has each own story, divided in two different paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/35c15d341c6b6c8126fa41a766bd2da3.poster.avif?t=1754100960\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/35c15d341c6b6c8126fa41a766bd2da3.apng?t=1754100960\" class=\"bb_img\" width=576 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize the main character with different hats, suits and shoes you will find through your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/938d73e3c76616bebbdffb6346f5cab0.poster.avif?t=1754100960\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/938d73e3c76616bebbdffb6346f5cab0.apng?t=1754100960\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the pages of a mysterious book called <strong>Paplion</strong>, strange monsters can be found. Those are called <strong>Papling</strong>, monsters born from paper. After being absorbed by the book, you will meet your partner <strong>Papling</strong> and together you will go in an adventure through the chapters of <strong>Paplion</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/04f83e1274e713e896281d975e08704c.poster.avif?t=1754100960\" width=64 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/04f83e1274e713e896281d975e08704c.webm?t=1754100960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Papling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find more than 100 different <strong>Papling</strong> to <strong>befriend</strong> and add them to your <strong>deck</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/2948702acb7787066c92ab8acbd95098.poster.avif?t=1754100960\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/2948702acb7787066c92ab8acbd95098.apng?t=1754100960\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose their evolution line</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Papling</strong> have <strong>3 evolutive stages</strong>. Those that aren't in the last stage can choose between 3 different evolutions to evolve, becoming stronger and gaining <strong>new abilities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/dfe8191390533eae6e688ec0d4e059e2.avif?t=1754100960\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple paths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paplion</strong> has <strong>6 chapters,</strong> each of them with its own world to explore and you can choose in which order you will play them. Also, each of them has each own story, divided in two different paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/35c15d341c6b6c8126fa41a766bd2da3.poster.avif?t=1754100960\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/35c15d341c6b6c8126fa41a766bd2da3.apng?t=1754100960\" class=\"bb_img\" width=576 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize the main character with different hats, suits and shoes you will find through your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/938d73e3c76616bebbdffb6346f5cab0.poster.avif?t=1754100960\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037480/extras/938d73e3c76616bebbdffb6346f5cab0.apng?t=1754100960\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p>",
